# Upstream: prepared for ISEEKYAN/Megatron-LM ds4_vllm_align_preview, not yet proposed.
#
# Source commits:
#   [mLite][DSv4] impl=vllm: refuse ROCm at build time (B2)
#   [mLite][DSv4] impl=vllm: ROCm kernel bindings; block-FP8 deployment = the export on ROCm
#   [mLite][DSv4] impl=vllm: ROCm attention forward on the rollout's prefill kernels
#   [mLite][DSv4] impl=vllm: ROCm MoE with the rollout's Triton experts and EP combine
#   [mLite][DSv4] impl=vllm: build on ROCm (BI=1, CP=1) with the rollout's facts
#   [mLite][verl] impl=vllm on ROCm: pass rollout EP, tokenizer size and resync_config
#   [mLite][DSv4] impl=vllm on ROCm: deterministic sparse-attention backward
#   [mLite][DSv4] impl=vllm: sum the embedding weight gradient in FP32
#   [mLite][DSv4] impl=vllm on ROCm: route-weight gradient from an FP32 GEMM output
#   [mLite][DSv4] impl=vllm on ROCm: run the mHC pre VJP eagerly
#
